WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.855
Module 3.

00:00:01.855 --> 00:00:03.510
Lending & Leverage.

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:05.425
Part of Stage 2, Practitioner.

00:00:06.725 --> 00:00:08.530
By the end of this module, you'll

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.759
be able to borrow against collateral with

00:00:10.759 --> 00:00:12.970
a buffer and a written defence plan.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:14.325
That's the standard.

00:00:14.325 --> 00:00:16.295
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:17.595 --> 00:00:19.277
There are 7 lessons, starting

00:00:19.277 --> 00:00:21.260
with How lending markets work.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.239
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:23.239 --> 00:00:25.510
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.428
If the topic is new to

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:31.260
you, start with Mastery Starter 3.0.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.155
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:33.155 --> 00:00:35.309
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:35.309 --> 00:00:37.440
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.247
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:41.280
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.065
Let's begin, with lesson 3.0.
